Follow the shared instructions in `~/.agents/instructions/global.md`. If they are unavailable, say so rather than inventing or duplicating them.

For Cursor-wide behavior, add this one-line User Rule under Customize → Rules → User Rules: `Follow the shared instructions in ~/.agents/instructions/global.md. If they are unavailable, say so rather than duplicating them.` User Rules are not stored in this dotfiles package; `.cursor/rules` applies only to repositories that load this file.
